    "T3": "C38_PLANT"
   },
   "plant": {
    "kind": "negation",
    "old": "\"We were led into speaking at greater length on these matters; but what we wish to understand is this: that a terrible, savage, and lawless kind of desire resides in everyone, even in some of us who appear utterly moderate; and this becomes evident in our sleep.",
